pplied name exactly matches the normalized official Steam name for the supplied App ID."],"research":{"steam":{"status":"success","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T10:31:38.552Z","error":null}},"steamMetadata":{"appId":"994280","links":{"store":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/994280/","officialWebsite":"http://gjqt3.wangyuan.com/","support":"http://service.wangyuan.com/"},"storageRequirements":{"kind":"required_free_space","windows":{"minimum":{"value":40,"unit":"GB","display":"40 GB","approximateBytes":40000000000,"evidenceText":"Storage: 40 GB"},"recommended":{"value":40,"unit":"GB","display":"40 GB","approximateBytes":40000000000,"evidenceText":"Storage: 40 GB"}},"macos":{"minimum":null,"recommended":null},"linux":{"minimum":null,"recommended":null},"note":"Steam publishes required free space, not the exact installed or download size."},"controllerSupport":{"level":"partial","xboxCompatible":null,"xboxEvidence":null,"note":"Generic Steam controller support does not prove Xbox controller compatibility."},"playerModes":{"singlePlayer":true,"multiplayer":false,"coop":false,"onlineCoop":false,"localCoop":false,"lanCoop":false,"sharedOrSplitScreen":false,"pvp":false,"maximumPlayers":null,"maximumPlayersNote":"The public Steam app-details response does not provide a reliable exact player limit.","evidence":["Single-player"]},"genres":["RPG"],"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":22,"description":"Steam Achievements"},{"id":18,"description":"Partial Controller Support"},{"id":42,"description":"Remote Play on Tablet"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}]}},"content":{"status":"success","steamAppId":"994280","steamName":"Gujian3(古剑奇谭三)","sourceUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/994280/","fetchedAt":"2026-10-16T09:58:27.854720+00:00","locales":{"en":{"status":"source","provider":"steam","shortDescription":"Gujian 3 is a mass 3D single-person RPG developed by Aurogon Info & Tech (Shanghai), a subsidiary of Wangyuan Shengtang. As the latest hit of the Gujian series, it boasts more free and smooth combat experience with its full real-time combat system. This generation expands the world of Gujian based on previous works.","detailedDescription":"Gujian 3 is a mass 3D single-person RPG developed by Aurogon Info & Tech (Shanghai), a subsidiary of Wangyuan Shengtang. As the latest hit of the Gujian series, it boasts more free and smooth combat experience with its full real-time combat system. This generation expands the world of Gujian based on previous works. The vivid and beautiful graphic style brings the scenery, people and stories from an ancient time to life and truly makes the game world alive!\nThe story background of Gujian 3 is a fantasy world built upon the elements of ancient China, therefore, players will experience rich cultural context all over the game, adding daring and limitless imagination to this oriental fantasia. \n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nClassic Single-player Game, Brand New All-real-time Combat\n \n[Free of Travel] Start fighting directly after entering combat without switching into combat scene. Enemies will take cover using the terrain and environment objects and try to ambush the player.\n[Special Combo Attack] Free combo between light and heavy attacks will generate Energy and Morale points while dealing damage, releasing powerful Special Attack/Morale Attack when reaching certain Energy/Morale value.\n[Use Strategy to Win] During combat, characters can switch to defense stance or dodge attacks at any time. However, these would cost Stamina points, so players will need to choose their strategies wisely according to the situation to keep their fights under control.\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nConstellation System and Powerful Pact Creatures\n \n[Constellation System] A simplified Constellation System that shows each character’s Constellation builds. Players can check and adjust Constellation with just a few clicks.\n[Pact Creatures] Make pacts with various creatures by fulfilling their conditions, then summon Pact Creatures to assist you in combat or at Lotuscape. Each race has different skills that could greatly increase combat efficiency when used properly.\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nEnjoy Your Life in a Fully-updated Lotuscape System\n \n[Research & Crafting] New feature of the Lotuscape System allows players to invite artisans to Lotuscape for researching and crafting. Control Percy to help artisans solve unexpected troubles they encounter during their research. When the research is complete, artisans will be able to make them in batch.\n[Pact Creatures] Besides combat participation, pact creatures can also assist players in Lotuscape duties including farming, mining and exploring. When they’ve gained enough experience points, the creatures will level up and be of much greater assistance.\n[Decorate Own Space] More options when decorating Lotuscape. Find or craft houses, fences, floors, plants, rockery hills, tables, chairs and other items and decorate the Lotuscape courtyard of your own style.\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nEnjoy Leisure: Lost Tales & Questboard\n \n\n[Lost Tales] A special in-game card game, Lost Tales. Easy to catch up with the help of tutorials, even for players new to the series.\n[Questboard] As a classic element of the series, Questboard can still be found standing by the streets, providing plenty of quests for the players while telling the stories about the Gujian world and characters.\n\nConstant internet connection required for game","aboutGame":null},"vi":{"status":"pending_translation","provider":null,"shortDescription":null,"detailedDescription":null,"aboutGame":null}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app